  "question": {
    "en": "Children often do things that frustrate or upset parents. They might disobey or make their parents angry. We would like to know what you have done when your child did something to make you upset or angry.You will see a list of things you might have done in the past year and we would like you to indicate whether you have: done it once in past year, done it twice in the past year, 3-5 times in the past year, 6-10 times, 11-20 times, or more than 20 times in the past year. Your responses will not be shared with the HBCD sites or staff at the sites."
